OL,3,GNEWSAGas pipe replacement works to last
OL,4,Ainto new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to replace ageing metal gas pipes
OL,7,Fwith "more reliable" plastic ones will
OL,8,Flast into the new year.
OL,10,FNorthern Gas Networks (NGN) is starting
OL,11,Faround 16 weeks of work on Kirkleatham
OL,12,FLane and Broadway East in Redcar,
OL,13,FTeesside, on Monday.
OL,15,FTemporary multi-way traffic signals
OL,16,Fwill be in place during the project,
OL,17,Fstarting on Kirkleatham Lane at the
OL,18,Fjunction with Broadway East and moving
OL,19,Ftowards the junction with Ennis Road as
OL,20,Fwork progresses.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
