OL,3,GNEWSAGas pipe replacement works to last
OL,4,Ainto new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FSite manager Steven Storey said plastic
OL,7,Fpipes help reduce the risk of leaks,
OL,8,Fadding: "Modern plastic gas pipes do
OL,9,Fnot corrode, are highly resistant to
OL,10,Fwear and tear underground, and can flex
OL,11,Fwith ground movement."
